# SatQuery AI — Model 4: Evidence Grounding Layer

A single, self-contained Google Colab notebook that **loads all 3 trained model checkpoints from Google Drive**, generates answers **with visual evidence overlays** (attention heatmaps, change masks, bounding boxes, modality contribution), and provides a unified `generate_evidence()` interface. **No new training is required.**

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This model performs **no training** — it is purely an inference-time evidence-generation layer built on top of your 3 existing trained checkpoints. Total Colab runtime should be ~3–5 minutes (model loading only).

